Z||000006||GarethWright||10-31-2000||09:19 PM||||Some info I found on the web says a Fiero with a V6 should weigh 2778 lbs. It doesnt say if thats the GT body(which weighs more) or not though. Heres what I got:<BR>Top Speed: 120<BR>0-60 mph: 7.4 sec<BR>Engine Type: V6<BR>Displacement: 2.8 litres<BR>Max Power: 135 bhp @ 5200 RPM<BR>Max Torque: 170 lb-ft @ 3600 RPM<BR>Weight: 2778 lbs<BR>Gas Mileage: 26 mpg<BR>Price: $10,999||||reg||1
